  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 32 × 5 + 12 ÷ 4 - 18 = 29\n\nOption 1) ÷ and ×\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒** **__**32 ÷ 5**__ + 12 × 4 - 18 = 29\n\n⇒ 6.4 + __**12 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 18 = 29\n\n⇒ __**6.4**____** + **__**__48__** - 18 = 29\n\n⇒ __**54.4 - 18**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 36.4 ≠ 29\n\nOption 2) - and ×\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 32 - 5 + __**12 ÷ 4 **__× 18 = 29\n\n⇒ 32 - 5 + __**3 **____**×**____** 18**__ = 29\n\n⇒ **__32__** - 5 **__+ 54__** = 29\n\n⇒ __**86 - 5**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 81 ≠ 29\n\nOption 3) - and +\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 32 × 5 - __**12 ÷ 4**__ + 18 = 29\n\n⇒ **__32 × 5__** - 3 + 18 = 29\n\n⇒ __**160 **__- 3 __**+ 18**__ = 29\n\n⇒ **__178 - 3__** = 29\n\n⇒ 175 ≠ 29\n\n**Option 4) + and ×**\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 32 + 5 × __**12 ÷ 4**__ - 18 = 29\n\n⇒ 32 + __**5 × 3**__ - 18 = 29\n\n⇒ __**32 + ****1**__5 - 18 = 29\n\n⇒ __**47 - 18**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 29 = 29\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**+ and ×​****\"**.",
